'effective','transthoracic','vector','distance','aim','more','between','implanted','consistent','guidance','alternative','needed','lifesaving','seeking','ideal','orientation','favors','anterior','posterior','lateral','remains','avoids','permits','prompt','s-icd','location','subcutaneous','may','left','chest','where','would','normally','identify','actual','assuming','infraclavicular','implant','selection','acls','rhythm-specific','external-defibrillator','clinically','regardless','reduce','solely','protect','magnet','magnet-suspended','stop','sources','emi','remove','allow','native','therapy','observing','response','internal','programmed-off','removing','reverse','programmer-disabled','arrange','reprogramming','but','proceed','occur','distinction','pacing-only','generally','convert','its','pacing','asynchronous','mode','support','remain','separate','considerations','scientific','statement','after','following','without','interrupting','ongoing','assess','reset','programming','changes','impaired','defibrillator','function','continue','monitoring','rescue','readiness','keep','cardiac','rate','backup','available','until','permanent','settings','are','leaving','monitored','care','confirm','detection','re-enabled','document','plan','communicate','them','handoff'],9,true)
